  "description": "After losing his parents as a child and becoming a slave to the Demon King's army, he is rescued by the hero \"Uta.\" He then takes up his hammer and heads to the Street of Craftsmen, seeking what he truly desires. \n\nThe story of the blacksmiths who helped him, not found in the hero's fairy tale, is told here. \"Welcome to the Street of Craftsmen.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=847612), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13655146)",
